    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>STORM: lost normality</strong> is a first-person puzzle game with platformer elements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During the transfer of the secret cargo to another dimension, everything went wrong at once and a space-time storm began, threatening the fate of all mankind. Stop the storm and bring back the lost normality to this unhealthy world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Warp the space-time continuum to change gravity and speed of time</strong>  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Procedurally generated puzzles</strong> <br> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823480/extras/3f621f5acae9a7e1aed379f1bbb0bd5c.poster.avif?t=1745234491\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823480/extras/3f621f5acae9a7e1aed379f1bbb0bd5c.webm?t=1745234491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823480/extras/3f621f5acae9a7e1aed379f1bbb0bd5c.mp4?t=1745234491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Adjust the difficulty level of puzzles</strong> <br> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823480/extras/373904475a057871a10485c4578e9ee0.poster.avif?t=1745234491\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823480/extras/373904475a057871a10485c4578e9ee0.webm?t=1745234491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823480/extras/373904475a057871a10485c4578e9ee0.mp4?t=1745234491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></d